 "intro": "Finer time connectors: at once, at that moment, gradually, each time, and once something is done.",
 "palabras": [
  {
   "palabra": "apenas",
   "significado": "as soon as; hardly",
   "pron": "a-PE-nas",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "adverb",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "With the future it takes the subjunctive: «apenas llegues, llámame». With the past, the indicative: «apenas llegó, me llamó».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "nada más",
   "significado": "as soon as (+ infinitive)",
   "pron": "NA-da MAS",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It goes with an infinitive: «nada más llegar, me llamó». It shows one action follows another at once.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "a medida que",
   "significado": "as (gradually)",
   "pron": "a me-DI-da ke",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It describes a gradual change. With real facts, the indicative: «a medida que pasan las horas».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "conforme",
   "significado": "as (gradually)",
   "pron": "kon-FOR-me",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "conjunction",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "Here it is a conjunction of time: «conforme pasa el tiempo». It is used a lot in writing.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "cada vez que",
   "significado": "every time that",
   "pron": "KA-da beth ke",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "With habitual or past facts, the indicative: «cada vez que llamo». The z in «vez» sounds «th».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "desde que",
   "significado": "since (time)",
   "pron": "DES-de ke",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It marks the start of something that goes on: «desde que vivo aquí». It takes the indicative.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "una vez que",
   "significado": "once",
   "pron": "U-na beth ke",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It marks what is already done: «una vez que termines». With the future, the subjunctive.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "mientras tanto",
   "significado": "meanwhile",
   "pron": "MYEN-tras TAN-to",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It links two simultaneous actions. It goes at the start of the sentence, with a comma: «mientras tanto, espera».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "a los dos días",
   "significado": "two days later",
   "pron": "a los dos DI-as",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It counts from a moment in the past: «a los dos días, llamó». Alternative: «dos días después».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "equipo",
   "significado": "team",
   "pron": "e-KI-po",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "noun",
   "genero": "m",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It is masculine: «el equipo». It is also the set of devices for a job.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "despacho",
   "significado": "office (room)",
   "pron": "des-PA-cho",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "noun",
   "genero": "m",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It is one person's room, not the whole company. The «ch» sounds as in «chocolate».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
